24,0.09656233,-0.00711505,-0.01018028,0.00246277,0.02224002,-0.00021079,0.0298284,-0.10876951,0.01825136,0.04435255,0.19186513,-0.06014607,-0.04664353,0.04632894,-0.02876911,-0.03175498,0.01090845,0.01411764,0.01526506,0.02877506,0.124882,0.00661334,0.04064625,0.01158862,-0.04507668,-0.02381365,0.0027182,-0.01139175,0.03515879,-0.01993639,-0.01131234,0.02062501,0.04130477,-0.03586547,0.00701177,-0.06477821,-0.02936799,0.02952291,0.02178308,-0.01463211,-0.04166701,0.00588643,0.04615125,-0.00823043,-0.00494302,-0.0306028,-0.03776607,-0.04168724,0.00865808,0.01626581,-0.02477012,0.06347504,-0.05233249],"last_embed":{"hash":"jwzn6i","tokens":406}}},"last_read":{"hash":"jwzn6i","at":1774939544791},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1774939523468,"size":8192,"at":1774939536713,"hash":"jwzn6i"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,18],"#AI-driven personalized nutrition: RAG-based digital health solution for obesity and type 2 diabetes":[20,42],"#AI-driven personalized nutrition: RAG-based digital health solution for obesity and type 2 diabetes#{1}":[21,25],"#AI-driven personalized nutrition: RAG-based digital health solution for obesity and type 2 diabetes#📝 Benim Notlarım":[26,28],"#AI-driven personalized nutrition: RAG-based digital health solution for obesity and type 2 diabetes#📝 Benim Notlarım#{1}":[27,28],"#AI-driven personalized nutrition: RAG-based digital health solution for obesity and type 2 diabetes#🟡 Genel Bilgiler (Sarı)":[29,31],"#AI-driven personalized nutrition: RAG-based digital health solution for obesity and type 2 diabetes#🟢 Yöntem & Örneklem (Yeşil)":[32,34],"#AI-driven personalized nutrition: RAG-based digital health solution for obesity and type 2 diabetes#🟢 Yöntem & Örneklem (Yeşil)#{1}":[33,34],"#AI-driven personalized nutrition: RAG-based digital health solution for obesity and type 2 diabetes#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)":[35,37],"#AI-driven personalized nutrition: RAG-based digital health solution for obesity and type 2 diabetes#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)#{1}":[36,37],"#AI-driven personalized nutrition: RAG-based digital health solution for obesity and type 2 diabetes#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)":[38,40],"#AI-driven personalized nutrition: RAG-based digital health solution for obesity and type 2 diabetes#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)#{1}":[39,40],"#AI-driven personalized nutrition: RAG-based digital health solution for obesity and type 2 diabetes#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[41,42]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/TF9MS4CP","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/YLHC6J9H?page=1&annotation=6BLT4FQ5","line":33},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/YLHC6J9H?page=1&annotation=FXUBHACU","line":33},{"title":"Sayfa 2","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/YLHC6J9H?page=2&annotation=DAF52NE4","line":33},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/YLHC6J9H?page=1&annotation=PS4UTTLJ","line":36},{"title":"Sayfa 12","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/YLHC6J9H?page=12&annotation=EUGVGG25","line":36},{"title":"Sayfa 2","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/YLHC6J9H?page=2&annotation=R4TTC83K","line":36},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/YLHC6J9H?page=1&annotation=QKYBA52Q","line":39},{"title":"Sayfa 12","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/YLHC6J9H?page=12&annotation=TAT468KM","line":39},{"title":"Sayfa 2","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/YLHC6J9H?page=2&annotation=GBBS742R","line":39}],"metadata":{"Title":"AI-driven personalized nutrition: RAG-based digital health solution for obesity and type 2 diabetes","Authors":"Anand K. Gavai, Jos Van Hillegersberg","Year":2025,"DOI":"10.1371/journal.pdig.0000758","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"Here, we present an artificial intelligence (AI) driven dietary recommendation system that generates personalized smoothie recipes while prioritizing health outcomes and environmental sustainability. A key feature of the system is the “virtual nutritionist”, an iterative validation framework that dynamically refines recipes to meet predefined nutritional and sustainability criteria. The system integrates dietary guidelines from the National Institute for Public Health and the Environment (RIVM), EUFIC, USDA FoodData Central, and the American Diabetes Association with retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) to deliver evidence-based recommendationsBy aligning with the United Nations Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs), the system promotes plant-based, seasonal, and locally sourced ingredients to reduce environmental impact. We leverage explainable AI (XAI) to enhance user engagement through clear explanations of ingredient benefits and interactive features, improving comprehension across varying health literacy levels. Using zero-shot and few-shot learning techniques, the system adapts to user inputs while maintaining privacy through local deployment of the LLaMA3 model.ingredients. We’ve built in a “virtual nutritionist” that checks and refines each recipe to ensure it aligns with nutrition and environmental goals","Findings":"In evaluating 1,000 recipes, the system achieved 80.1% adherence to health guidelines meeting targets for calories, fiber, and fats and 92% compliance with sustainability criteria, emphasizing seasonal and locally sourced ingredients.Unlike many AI tools, ours runs locally, keeping personal data private and secure. In testing, 80% of the recipes met strict nutritional targets, and 92% used sustainable ingredients. A web app lets users receive their personalized recipes in real time, with clear explanations for every choice made.This study demonstrates the successful implementation of a Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) system that translates Dutch dietary guidelines into actionable smoothie recipes for managing obesity and type 2 diabetes","Conclusions":"A prototype web application enables real-time, personalized recommendations, bridging the gap between AI-driven insights and clinical dietary management. This research underscores the potential of AI-driven precision nutrition to revolutionize chronic disease management by improving dietary adherence, enhancing health literacy, and offering a scalable, adaptable solution for clinical workflows, telehealth platforms, and public health initiatives, with the potential to significantly alleviate the global healthcare burdenOur work shows how AI can translate expert advice into everyday actions, supporting healthier lifestyles and empowering people to make better food choices—no matter their level of health knowledge.The validation framework effectively converts complex nutritional guidelines into quantifiable recipe parameters, providing a foundation for integration into real-world healthcare settings, such as telemedicine platforms or chronic disease management programs. This adaptability enhances its potential to improve patient adherence and support clinician-led dietary interventions.","Limitations":"","User_Notes":"biz de tüber için tarifler oluşturan bir arayüz ekleyebiliriz proje fikrim için."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"jwzn6i","at":1774939544586}},"smart_blocks:Augmented Dietitian Okunmuşlar/gavaiAIdrivenPersonalizedNutrition2025a.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.06530955,0.00640796,0.00524073,-0.01156808,0.00936766,0.01754652,-0.00866878,0.02936313,0.02208068,0.00087346,-0.00519142,-0.08984084,0.02151132,0.05080693,0.05573906,-0.01056592,0.02080727,0.0282913,-0.01245604,-0.03078515,0.07173607,-0.03161266,0.01868673,-0.03448291,0.01248967,0.03490078,-0.0157929,-0.04518886,-0.07851315,-0.2116351,0.00515936,-0.0332653,0.0761591,-0.01426962,-0.07126419,0.02978077,0.02522414,0.02028285,-0.06081293,0.0125972,0.0277339,0.00917028,0.0641156,0.00248199,0.03610306,0.00778166,-0.048